-- CHIEF: reference seed data (fictional names; C001-C004 = anonymous OSDR Inspiration4 codes).
--
-- Do NOT run this with the sqlite3 client: reset.js loads it and replaces {{NOW}} with the reference
-- instant ('YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ssZ'). That keeps dates relative to "now" so the demo does not drift as
-- days go by. To freeze the instant: CHIEF_NOW=2026-11-14T10:00:00Z npm run db:reset
-- Simulated data (vitals, sleep, environment...) is generated by seed-simulated.js.
-- This file is UTF-8: always load it from Node (readFileSync 'utf8'), not with PowerShell redirections.

